| AsyncWindowContext | owned + Clone | AsyncApp + AnyWindowHandle | 窗口相关异步操作，返回 Result | cx.spawn_in 回调参数 |
| TestAppContext | owned | 测试专用 | 虚拟时钟、输入模拟 | #[gpui::test] (test-support feature) |

Deref chain: Context<T> →(Deref/DerefMut)→ App; AsyncWindowContext →(Deref/DerefMut)→ AsyncApp; AsyncApp -×-> App (不 Deref，而是每次调用短暂借用 RefCell).

